sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor AG as Agente
    participant A as api
    participant P as PostgreSQL
    participant R as Redis
    participant G as gateway
    actor S as Supervisor
    AG->>A: POST /api/announcements/{id}/ack
    A->>P: BEGIN
    A->>P: ¿es destinatario? (announcement_recipients)
    alt no es destinatario
        A-->>AG: 404 not_found
    else
        A->>P: INSERT announcement_acks ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING
        alt ya había confirmado
            A->>P: SELECT acknowledged_at original
        else primera confirmación
            A->>P: si todos confirmaron → next_reminder_at = NULL
        end
        A->>P: COMMIT
        A->>R: invalida la caché del agente
        A-->>AG: 200 { acknowledgedAt }
        A->>R: emit announcement:acknowledged
        R-->>G: Pub/Sub
        G-->>S: el porcentaje sube en vivo
    end
